  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is targeting 300 vulnerable host and displaced households Umogidi and Enegili-Ogoli Ugboju wards in Otukpo LGA of Benue state.  At the end of the project, it is expected that the challenges of food insecurity, water, basic health, and the resilience of community people to shocks and displacement occasioned by armed conflict and environmental disasters would d be greatly enhanced.</narrative>
